OL,3,GNEWSAUnknown Canaletto work fetches
OL,4,A#135,000 at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FA previously unknown work by the
OL,7,Frevered Italian artist Canaletto has
OL,8,Ffetched #135,000 at auction.
OL,10,FThe rare artwork, known as a capriccio,
OL,11,Fmore than doubled its estimated price
OL,12,Fat a sale by Mallams auction house in
OL,13,FOxford earlier.
OL,15,FCanaletto, whose real name was Giovanni
OL,16,FAntonio Canal, was born in Venice in
OL,17,F1697 and went on to become a favourite
OL,18,Fof British art collectors.
OL,23,APub: 21-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageB S Eng NewsC  Reg TVF Weather
FL,339,330,200,160,0,100
