OL,3,GNEWSAUnknown Canaletto work fetches
OL,4,A#135,000 at auction
OL,5,
OL,6,FAhead of the auction, Mallams said the
OL,7,Fartwork had been created by the 18th
OL,8,FCentury Venetian master with a pen,
OL,9,Fbrown ink and a light grey wash on
OL,10,Fpaper.
